	"Description": "Binary diff/patch feature for HotPatcher BinariesPatch. Self-contained byte-level delta (no external HDiffPatch C lib required). Format-agnostic: works for .pak and .utoc/.ucas. Rebuilt per imzlp articles https://imzlp.com/posts/25136/ and https://imzlp.com/posts/12188/ to replace the dead hxhb/HDiffPatchUE submodule.",
